@startuml system-context
!include _theme.iuml
left to right direction

actor "Repository\noperator" as Operator
actor "CI/CD\nautomation" as Automation
actor "TypeScript\napplication" as Application

rectangle "Octoform 0.3.1\n\nSoftware system that resolves declarative policy,\nobserves GitHub state, produces a deterministic diff,\nand applies only confirmed executable changes." as Octoform

cloud "GitHub.com\n\nRepository and organization APIs\nand governed resources" as GitHub

Operator -right-> Octoform : configure and confirm; receive plans and outcomes
Automation -right-> Octoform : audit or protected execution; receive report and exit code
Application -right-> Octoform : call ESM exports; receive typed results
Octoform -right-> GitHub : read state and apply permitted changes\nthrough the REST API

note bottom of Octoform
  Current boundary: one owner per resolved configuration.
  Version 0.3.1 uses the GitHub REST API only.
end note
@enduml
